        ]
      },
      "body": {
        "text": "Early testing by Artificial Analysis, via The Register, puts it between DeepSeek V4.1 Flash and OpenAI's GPT6 Luna: well behind OpenAI and Anthropic flagships, well ahead of top US open-weight Inkling.",
        "facts": [
          "F5"
        ]
